---
title: Routed 专家 Parameter 的状态变化
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    accTitle: 一层 routed 专家 Parameter 从分片到更新
    accDescr: 跟踪同一层的 W1 和 W2。Expert-FSDP 管理 Parameter，MegaMoE 执行池接收权重副本，autograd tape 保存反向上下文。

    state "Expert-FSDP 权重分片" as Sharded
    state "完整 home 权重可供前向" as ForwardReady
    state "前向已返回，tape 就绪" as ForwardReturned
    state "完整 home 权重可供反向" as BackwardReady
    state "home dW 已收齐 EP 贡献" as HomeGrad
    state "梯度与参数按分片对齐" as ShardGrad
    state "本步完成，梯度已清理" as StepDone

    [*] --> Sharded : I08 I15 先沿 EP 切专家，再装配 Expert-FSDP
    Sharded --> ForwardReady : F17 F18 层入口 all-gather / unshard
    ForwardReady --> ForwardReturned : F08 F13 F15 刷新 SHMEM home，保存 tape
    ForwardReturned --> BackwardReady : U02 U10 反向 hook 按需恢复参数
    BackwardReady --> HomeGrad : B13 B16 EP 内归主，返回 home dW
    HomeGrad --> ShardGrad : U04 Expert-FSDP reduce-scatter
    ShardGrad --> StepDone : U06 U07 U08 裁剪、条件更新、清梯度
    StepDone --> Sharded : 下一 step 使用当前权重
    StepDone --> [*] : 训练循环结束

    note right of ForwardReturned
        F19 按配置 reshard。
        U01 checkpoint 可按需重算。
    end note
    note right of BackwardReady
        B03 B04 从当前权重刷新 home。
        B07 用原 placement 和新 epoch。
    end note

    classDef framework fill:#eaf2ff,stroke:#5378a1,color:#15283f
    classDef fsdp fill:#eaf7f0,stroke:#438269,color:#15283f
    classDef native fill:#fff3e6,stroke:#a16a37,color:#15283f
    class Sharded,ForwardReady,BackwardReady,ShardGrad fsdp
    class ForwardReturned,HomeGrad native
    class StepDone framework
